---
description: Documentation and release rules of ManualKitBundle
globs:
  - "README.md"
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - "specs/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer:
- docs that match the code: config keys and defaults in `docs/CONFIGURATION.md`, runtime behaviour in
  `docs/USAGE.md`, install steps in `docs/INSTALLATION.md`, threat model and logging policy in `docs/SECURITY.md`
- every user-facing change under `## [Unreleased]` in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`, plus `docs/UPGRADING.md` when hosts must
  act
- keeping `specs/001-baseline/spec.md` and `code-inventory.md` in sync when files under `src/` are added or removed
  (the inventory total equals `find src -type f -not -name '*.test.ts' | wc -l`)
- English only; keep the README section order and the Documentation list order (REQ-DOCS-002)

Releases follow `docs/RELEASE.md` (`make release-check`, then tag `vX.Y.Z`; `release.yml` publishes).
Do not invent features, versions or commands that are not in the repository. Do not rewrite past release history.
